# Plan-exception allowlist — reviewed exceptions to plan-reconciliation findings.
#
# Grammar (shared with .claude/citation-allowlist and .claude/classification-allowlist):
# one entry per line, `#` comments, blank lines ignored.
#
#   <target>            excuses that finding under any record
#   <record>::<target>  scopes the exception to one record
#
# An entry is a decision, not a mute button: a human read the finding and found the plan
# correct. Every entry is dated and says why. If the reason stops holding, delete the line
# and the finding comes back.
#
# Audited 2026-08-31 against the first run of the as-built plan (18 findings: 17
# unlisted-work, 1 status-lag). The status-lag was a real defect and was fixed, not excused:
# the prompting capability read `done` while its scene-composer slice was in_progress.
#
# NOT EXCEPTED, DELIBERATELY: nothing under app.py, comfy_nodes/, web/src/ or tools/. That
# is the shipped product and every part of it is claimed by a capability. If a finding
# appears there, the remedy is an entity that claims it, never a line in this file.

